#: ../../../headers/math/index.rst:542
msgid ""
"Exhaustive tests check every representable point in the input space. This "
"method is used for half-precision functions and single-precision univariate "
"functions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../headers/math/index.rst:543
msgid ""
"Randomized tests check a large, deterministic subset of the input space, "
"typically using 2\\ :sup:`32` samples. This method is used for functions "
"with larger input spaces, such as single-precision bivariate and double-"
"precision functions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../headers/math/index.rst:544
msgid ""
"ULP tolerances are based on The Khronos Group, `The OpenCL C Specification "
"v3.0.19 <https://registry.khronos.org/OpenCL/specs/3.0-unified/html/OpenCL_C."
"html>`_, Sec. 7.4, Khronos Registry [July 10, 2025]."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../headers/math/index.rst:545
